      "content": "it's hard to see it as just a story though. it feels more like a pattern. like, if i keep going, i'm just going to keep passing this misery down to anyone i touch. it feels like the only way to actually stop it, to make sure it doesn't go any further, is for me to be the one who just... stops the line.",
