      "content": "i hear you, but i don't know if i have the strength to \"heal.\" what if i can't? it feels more selfless to just make sure the cycle ends permanently right here. like, if i'm gone, the damage ends with me. it feels like the only way to actually protect people from the mess i'm supposed to become. isn't there a certain kind of peace in just letting the chain end?",
